  "prefLabel": "He-P 4034.23 Posting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4034.23 Posting.\n\n(a) All areas in which industrial radiography is being performed shall be conspicuously posted as required by He-P 4022.12.\n\n(b) The exceptions listed in He-P 4022.13 of this chapter do not apply to industrial radiographic operations.\n\nSource. #6942, eff 2-1-99; ss by #8800, INTERIM, eff 2-1-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-07\n\nNew. #8959, eff 8-7-07; ss by #10983, eff 11-24-15; ss by #12626, eff 9-26-18; ss by #14325, eff 7-19-25, EXPIRES: 7-19-35",
